hadiths[50]{hadithnumber,text}:
"844","Abdullah bin Amr bin Al-Aas (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke aik aadmi ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se poochha: Kaun sa Islam behtar hai? Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Tu khana khilaye aur salaam karey jisey tu jaanta hai aur jisey tu nahi jaanta. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"845","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab Allah Taala ne Aadam (Alehis salaam) ko paida kya to farmaya: Jao aur un par salaam karo, farishton ki aik jamaat baithi hui thi, phir suno ke wo tumhey kya tohfa detey hain, kyonke wahi tumhara aur tumhari aulaad ka tohfa hai. To unhon-ne kaha: Assalamu alaikum. To unhon-ne kaha: Assalamu alaika wa rehmatullah, to unhon-ne wa rehmatullah ka izafa kya. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"846","Abu Umara Bara bin Aazib (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne hamein saat baaton ka hukm diya: mareez ki ayadat ka, janazon ke peechey chalney ka, chheekney waley ko yarhamukallah kehney ka, kamzor ki madad ka, mazloom ki a'anat ka, salaam pheelaney ka aur qasam khaney waley ki qasam poori karne ka. (Muttafaqun aleh, ye Bukhari ki aik riwayat ka lafz hai)."
"847","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Tum Jannat mein dakhil nahi hosaktey yahan tak ke imaan lao aur tum imaan nahi la saktey yahan tak ke aapas mein mohabbat karo, kya main tumhey aisi chiz na bataun ke jab tum usey karo to aapas mein mohabbat karney lago? Aapas mein salaam pheelayo. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"848","Abu Yusuf Abdullah bin Salaam (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Ae logon! Salaam pheelayo, aur khana khilayo, aur rishtey joro aur namaz padho jab log so rahey hon, Jannat mein salaamti ke sath dakhil hojaogey. Ise Tirmizi ne riwayat kya hai aur kaha: Hasan sahih hadis hai."
"849","Tufail bin Ubayy bin Kaab se riwayat hai ke wo Abdullah bin Umar ke paas aatey to unke sath subah bazaar jatey, unhon-ne kaha: Phir jab ham subah bazaar jatey to Abdullah na kisi chhotey dukandaar par guzartey aur na kisi bade saudaagar par, aur na kisi maskeen par aur na kisi par magar usey salaam kartey, Tufail ne kaha: To main aik din Abdullah bin Umar ke paas aaya to unhon-ne mujhey bazaar chalney ke liye sath liya, to main ne un se kaha: Tum bazaar mein kya kartey ho jabke tum na sauda par thehrtey ho aur na saamaan ke baarey mein poochhtey ho, aur na uska bhao lagatey ho, aur na bazaar ki majlison mein baithetey ho? Aur main kehta hun: Hamarey sath yahan baitho ham baatein kartey hain. To unhon-ne kaha: Ae Abu Batn, aur Tufail pait waley they, ham sirf salaam ke liye subah jaatey hain taake jisey milein usey salaam karein. Ise Maalik ne Muwatta mein sahih sanad se riwayat kya hai."
"850","Imran bin Husain (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Aik aadmi Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas aaya phir us ne kaha: Assalamu alaikum, to Aap ne usey jawab diya phir wo baith gaya, to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Das. Phir aik aur aaya, to us ne kaha: Assalamu alaikum wa rehmatullah, to Aap ne usey jawab diya phir wo baith gaya, to Aap ne farmaya: Bees. Phir aik aur aaya, to us ne kaha: Assalamu alaikum wa rehmatullahi wa barakatuhu, to Aap ne usey jawab diya phir wo baith gaya, to Aap ne farmaya: Tees. Ise Abu Dawud aur Tirmizi ne riwayat kya hai aur kaha: Hasan hadis hai."
"851","Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mujh se farmaya: Ye Jibraeel hain jo tumhey salaam kehtey hain. Unhon-ne kaha: Main ne kaha: Un par salaam aur Allah ki rehmat aur uski barkatein hon. (Muttafaqun aleh). Aur Sahihain ki baaz riwayaat mein is tarah aaya hai: wa barakatuhu, aur baaz mein uska hazf hai, aur siqa rawi ka izafa maqbool hai."
"852","Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) jab koi baat farmatey to usey teen martaba dohratey yahan tak ke Aap se samajh liya jata, aur jab kisi qaum ke paas aatey aur unhey salaam kartey to unhey teen martaba salaam kartey. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kya hai. Aur ye us waqt par mehmool hai jab jamaat bahut badi ho."
"853","Miqdaad (Raziallahu anhu) se unki taweel hadis mein riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Ham Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke liye doodh mein se Aap ka hissa utha kar rakhtey they, to Aap raat mein tashreef laatey aur aisa salaam farmatey jo soney waley ko na jagata aur jaagne waley ko sunai deta, phir Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) tashreef laey aur Aap ne salaam kya jaisa salaam kartey they. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"854","Asma bint Yazeed (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) aik din masjid mein guzrey jabke aurton ki aik jamaat baithi hui thi, to Aap ne haath se ishara karke salaam kya. Ise Tirmizi ne riwayat kya hai aur kaha: Hasan hadis hai."
"855","Abu Umama (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak logon mein Allah ke nazdeek sab se zyada haqdaar wo hai jo unhey salaam mein pehel karey. Ise Abu Dawud ne jayyad sanad se riwayat kya hai, aur Tirmizi ne isi tarah riwayat kya hai aur kaha: Hasan hadis hai, aur uske baad ye zikr kya hai."
"856","Abu Jurayy Hujaimi (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas aaya phir main ne kaha: Alaikas salaam ya Rasulullah. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Alaikas salaam na kaho, kyonke alaikas salaam murdon ka tohfa hai. Ise Abu Dawud aur Tirmizi ne riwayat kya hai aur kaha: Hasan sahih hadis hai. Aur ye apni taveel soorat mein guzar chuki hai."
"857","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Sawaar paidal par salaam karey, aur paidal baithey huey par, aur thorey zyada par. (Muttafaqun aleh). Aur Bukhari ki aik riwayat mein hai: Aur chhota badey par."
"858","Abu Umama Sudy bin Ajlaan Bahili (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak logon mein Allah ke nazdeek sab se zyada haqdaar wo hai jo unhey salaam mein pehel karey. Ise Abu Dawud ne jayyad sanad se riwayat kya hai. Aur Tirmizi ne Abu Umama (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat kya hai: Kaha gaya: Ya Rasulullah! Do aadmi miltey hain, un mein se kaun salaam mein pehel karey? Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Un mein se jo Allah Taala ke zyada qareeb hai. Tirmizi ne kaha: Hasan hadis hai."
"859","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se namaz buri tarah padhney waley ki hadis mein riwayat hai ke wo aaya phir us ne namaz padhi, phir Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas aaya aur Aap ko salaam kya, to Aap ne usey salaam ka jawab diya, phir farmaya: Wapas jao aur namaz padho, kyonke tum ne namaz nahi padhi. To wo wapas gaya aur us ne namaz padhi, phir aaya aur Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko salaam kya, yahan tak ke us ne teen martaba aisa kya. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"860","Unhin se Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi apne bhai se miley to usey salaam karey, phir agar un donon ke darmiyaan darakht ya deewaar ya pathar haail ho jaey phir us se miley to usey salaam karey. Ise Abu Dawud ne riwayat kya hai."
"861","Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mujh se farmaya: Ae merey betey! Jab tum apne ghar walon ke paas dakhil ho to salaam karo, tumharey liye aur tumharey ghar walon ke liye barkat hogi. Ise Tirmizi ne riwayat kya hai aur kaha: Hasan sahih hadis hai."
"862","Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke wo bachchon par guzrey to unhey salaam kya, aur kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) aisa kartey they. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"863","Sehel bin Saad (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Ham mein aik aurat thi, aur aik riwayat mein hai: Hamari aik boodhi aurat thi, jo chaqandar ki jadon mein se leti aur usey degchi mein daalti aur jau ke chand daaney peesti, phir jab ham Juma padhtey aur wapas aatey to usey salaam kartey, to wo usey hamarey saamney karti. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kya hai."
"864","Umm Haani Faakhta bint Abi Taalib (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main Fatah ke din Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas aai jabke Aap ghusl farma rahey they aur Faatima Aap ko kapdey se parda kar rahi thein, to main ne salaam kya, aur hadis zikr ki. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"865","Asma bint Yazeed (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) aurton mein se hamarey paas se guzrey aur hamein salaam kya. Ise Abu Dawud aur Tirmizi ne riwayat kya hai aur kaha: Hasan hadis hai, aur ye Abu Dawud ka lafz hai. Aur Tirmizi ka lafz hai: Ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) aik din masjid mein guzrey jabke aurton ki aik jamaat baithi hui thi, to Aap ne haath se ishara karke salaam kya."
"866","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Yahood aur Nasaara ko salaam mein pehel na karo, phir jab tum un mein se kisi se rastey mein milo to usey uske tang hissey ki taraf kar do. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"867","Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab Ahle Kitaab tumhey salaam karein to kaho: Wa alaikum. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"868","Usama (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) aik majlis par guzrey jis mein Musalmanon aur mushrikon, but paraston aur Yahood ka mila jula giroh tha, to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unhey salaam kya. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"869","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi majlis mein pahunchy to salaam karey, phir jab uthney ka irada karey to salaam karey, to pehli doosri se zyada haqdaar nahi. Ise Abu Dawud aur Tirmizi ne riwayat kya hai aur kaha: Hasan hadis hai."
"870","Abu Musa Ashari (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Ijazat teen martaba hai, phir agar tumhey ijazat di jaey warna wapas laut jao. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"871","Sehel bin Saad se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Ijazat to aankh ki wjah se muqarrar ki gai hai. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"872","Ribee bin Hiraash se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Bani Aamir ke aik aadmi ne hamein hadis bayan ki ke us ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se ijazat maangi jabke Aap ghar mein they, to us ne kaha: Kya main dakhil hun? To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne apne khaadim se farmaya: Iske paas jao aur usey ijazat maangna sikhao, to us se kaho ke kahey: Assalamu alaikum, kya main dakhil hun? To us aadmi ne usey suna phir us ne kaha: Assalamu alaikum, kya main dakhil hun? To Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne usey ijazat di aur wo dakhil hua. Ise Abu Dawud ne sahih sanad se riwayat kya hai."
"873","Kalda bin Hanbal (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas aaya aur Aap ke paas baghair salaam ke dakhil hua, to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Wapas jao aur kaho: Assalamu alaikum, kya main dakhil hun? Ise Abu Dawud aur Tirmizi ne riwayat kya hai aur kaha: Hasan hadis hai."
"874","Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se unki mashhoor Meraj wali hadis mein riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Phir Jibraeel mujhey aasmaane duniya ki taraf lekar chadhey aur darwaza khulwaya, to kaha gaya: Ye kaun hai? Unhon-ne kaha: Jibraeel. Kaha gaya: Aur tumharey sath kaun hai? Unhon-ne kaha: Muhammad. Phir doosrey aur teesrey aur chauthey aasmaan ki taraf chadhey aur baqi tamaam, aur har aasmaan ke darwazey par kaha jata hai: Ye kaun hai? To wo kehtey hain: Jibraeel. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"875","Abu Zarr (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main raaton mein se aik raat nikla to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) tanha chal rahey they, to main chaand ke saaey mein chalney laga, phir Aap ne mur kar mujhey dekha aur farmaya: Ye kaun hai? To main ne kaha: Abu Zarr. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"876","Umm Haani (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas aai jabke Aap ghusl farma rahey they aur Faatima Aap ko parda kar rahi thein, to Aap ne farmaya: Ye kaun hai? To main ne kaha: Main Umm Haani hun. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"877","Jabir (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas aaya aur darwaza khatkhataya, to Aap ne farmaya: Kaun hai? To main ne kaha: Main, to Aap ne farmaya: Main main?! Goya Aap ne isey napasand farmaya. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"878","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak Allah chheenk ko pasand farmata hai aur jamai ko napasand farmata hai, phir jab tum mein se koi chheenkkey aur Allah Taala ki hamd karey to har Musalman par jo usey suney haq hai ke us se kahey: Yarhamukallah, aur rahi jamai to wo sirf shaitaan ki taraf se hai, phir jab tum mein se koi jamai ley to usey jahan tak ho sakey rokey, kyonke tum mein se jab koi jamai leta hai to shaitaan us se hansta hai. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kya hai."
"879","Unhin se Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi chheenkkey to kahey: Alhamdolillah, aur uska bhai ya uske saathi us se kahein: Yarhamukallah, phir jab wo us se kahey: Yarhamukallah, to wo kahey: Yahdikumullah wa yuslihu baalakum. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kya hai."
"880","Abu Musa (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Jab tum mein se koi chheenkkey aur Allah ki hamd karey to usey yarhamukallah kaho, phir agar wo Allah ki hamd na karey to usey yarhamukallah na kaho. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"881","Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas do aadmiyon ne chheenkki, to Aap ne aik ko yarhamukallah kaha aur doosrey ko yarhamukallah na kaha, to jisey yarhamukallah nahi kaha tha us ne kaha: Fulaan ne chheenkki to Aap ne usey yarhamukallah kaha, aur main ne chheenkki to mujhey yarhamukallah nahi kaha? To Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Is ne Allah ki hamd ki aur tum ne Allah ki hamd nahi ki. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"882","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) jab chheenktey to apna haath ya kapda apne munh par rakhtey aur us se apni awaz past kartey. Rawi ko shak hai. Ise Abu Dawud aur Tirmizi ne riwayat kya hai aur kaha: Hasan sahih hadis hai."
"883","Abu Musa (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Yahood Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas chheenktey they is ummeed par ke Aap un se kaheingey: Yarhamukumullah, to Aap farmatey: Yahdikumullah wa yuslihu baalakum. Ise Abu Dawud aur Tirmizi ne riwayat kya hai aur kaha: Hasan sahih hadis hai."
"884","Abu Saeed Khudri (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi jamai ley to apna haath apne munh par rakhey, kyonke shaitaan dakhil hota hai. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"885","Abul Khattab Qatada se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Anas se kaha: Kya Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sahaaba mein musafaha tha? Unhon-ne kaha: Haan. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kya hai."
"886","Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Jab Ahle Yaman aey to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Tumharey paas Ahle Yaman aa gaey hain, aur wo sab se pehley hain jo musafaha lekar aey. Ise Abu Dawud ne sahih sanad se riwayat kya hai."
"887","Bara (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Do Musalman nahi miltey aur musafaha kartey hain magar unke judaa honay se pehley unhey bakhsh diya jata hai. Ise Abu Dawud ne riwayat kya hai."
"888","Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Aik aadmi ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Ham mein se aik aadmi apne bhai ya dost se milta hai, to kya wo uske liye jhukey? Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Nahi. Us ne kaha: To kya wo us se lipt-ta hai aur usey chum-ta hai? Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Nahi. Us ne kaha: To wo uska haath pakadta hai aur us se musafaha karta hai? Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Haan. Ise Tirmizi ne riwayat kya hai aur kaha: Hasan hadis hai."
"889","Safwaan bin Assaal (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Aik Yahoodi ne apne saathi se kaha: Hamarey sath chalo is Nabi ke paas, phir wo donon Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas aey aur unhon-ne Aap se nau wazeh nishaniyon ke baarey mein sawal kya, phir hadis ko uske qaul tak zikr kya: To unhon-ne Aap ka haath aur paaon chuma aur kaha: Ham gawahi detey hain ke Aap Nabi hain. Ise Tirmizi waghera ne sahih asaneed se riwayat kya hai."
"890","Ibn Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se aik qissey mein riwayat hai jis mein unhon-ne kaha: To ham Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke qareeb huey aur ham ne Aap ka haath chuma. Ise Abu Dawud ne riwayat kya hai."
"891","Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Zaid bin Haarisa Madina aey jabke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) merey ghar mein they, to wo Aap ke paas aey aur darwaza khatkhataya, to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) unki taraf apna kapda ghaseet-tey huey uth-tey, phir Aap ne un se muanaqa kya aur unhey chuma. Ise Tirmizi ne riwayat kya hai aur kaha: Hasan hadis hai."
"892","Abu Zarr (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mujh se farmaya: Neki mein se kisi chiz ko haqeer na samjho chaahey apne bhai se khanda peshani se milna ho. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"893","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Hasan bin Ali (Raziallahu anhuma) ko chuma, to Aqra bin Haabis ne kaha: Beshak merey das betey hain main ne un mein se kisi ko nahi chuma. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo rehem nahi karta us par rehem nahi kya jata! (Muttafaqun aleh)."
